'''Velenki''' was a small settlement located on [[Rattatak]]. Its inhabitants led the [[Jedi]] [[Ky Narec]] and his apprentice [[Asajj Ventress]] into a trap under threats from the [[warlord]] [[Osika Kirske]]. When the Jedi arrived to help the village, they were surrounded by [[Weequay]] [[Pirate|raiders]], who [[Death|killed]] Narec. Despite the fact that they followed his demands, Kirske nevertheless burned the village using [[paralene]].<ref name="Dooku: Jedi Lost" />

